            "review_title": "Review at The Curry House",
            "review_text": "Nadja Abigail L\n16 contributions\n1\nDelish solo dinner\nMar 2020 • Solo\nOrdered Aloo Gobi, Baingan Burtha, Garlic Naan and Mixed Fruit Lassi and loved all of it. There were complimentary food stuff as well like yoghurt and dessert. The owner and chef speak good English. Will definitely go back.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 13, 2020",
